# pic
===
 PIC — Personal Image Catalogue. Miss Picasa or classic iPhoto? PIC brings that familiar photo-library experience to Linux. A free, open-source photo manager and editor built with Rust, GTK4 & libadwaita. Fast, lightweight and inspired by the classics. Not affiliated with Google or Apple.
